    <h2>Source-Only Packages (GPL-3 / LGPL-3)</h2>
    <p>The packages below carry GPL-3 or LGPL-3 licenses and are therefore <em>not</em> included in the distributed binary flavors. They are targeted primarily at the <code>macos</code> build, where Xcode and the Command Line Tools do not ship the GNU build-tool chain (autoconf, automake, libtool, m4, bison, texinfo) or the LGPL-3 multiprecision libraries (GMP, MPFR, MPC) that the scientific stack needs. SCLS also ships a recipe for GCC itself, so the <code>macos</code> flavor can produce its own Fortran-capable toolchain from source. These packages are provided only through the <code>./scls</code> Unix build script and never appear in the binary RPM distribution.</p>
    <table class="package-table">
        <tr class="gray-bg">
